    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSet in the highly sought-after Oakpark area of Tralee, this exceptional four-bedroom detached bungalow presents a rare opportunity to acquire a home of outstanding quality, style and finish. \n \nMeticulously maintained and presented in pristine decorative condition, the property has been finished to an exceptionally high standard throughout, with an impressive blend of bespoke detailing, high quality materials and elegant finishes creating a home that is both luxurious and exceptionally comfortable. \n \nFrom the striking entrance hall and bespoke double-glazed sash windows to the beautiful porcelain tiling, high quality flooring, granite worktops and a superbly hand crafted kitchen ,high ceilings throughout and two stunning fireplaces, every element has been carefully considered. Bright, spacious and ready for immediate occupation, this is a superbly appointed home where the quality of finish is evident from the moment you step through the door.\n \nThe property has been exceptionally well maintained and is presented throughout in tasteful neutral tones, creating a bright, welcoming and versatile interior. \n \nUpon entering the property, you are welcomed by a spacious and impressive entrance hall, where the high ceilings immediately create a wonderful sense of space and grandeur. The accommodation is thoughtfully arranged, with the bedrooms to the left and the principal living areas to the right.\n \nThe accommodation is well proportioned, with four generous bedrooms all of which benefit from their own en-suite facilities, providing an excellent level of comfort and privacy for family members or guests.\n \nLiving accommodation includes a large livingroom, cloakroom, WC, office, utility, kitchen/diningroom and seperate lounge/playroom. \n \nThe finish of the property is simply sublime with porcelain tiling and carpet flooring throughout, a handcrafted kitchen with warm granite worktops, a traditional style Range Master cooker and a striking central island, the space is ideal for both family life and entertaining. The property has bespoke double glazed sash windows throughout and is serviced by OFCH and mains sewage.\n \nThis space also includes bright dining area with tall bay windows overlooking the mature gardens with a cosy lounge / playroom located just off this open plan area. \n \nExternally, the property benefits from a private, well-defined beautifully landscaped garden, offering an excellent space for outdoor relaxation, entertaining or family use. The property is approached through electric gates, providing both privacy and security, with ample parking with an attached garage for extra storage.\n \nLocated in Oakpark, the property enjoys a convenient position within Tralee town, close to a wide range of schools, shops, sporting facilities, amenities and transport links, while still benefiting from the privacy and space associated with a detached bungalow. The MTU North Campus and The New Astellas facility is 1.3km from the property while Tralee town centre is just 2km away."
      },
